You are try-catching the creation of the other mempool, but not this one. Can you try-catch both? Something like
```
                 if self.ddp_config.use_distributed_optimizer:
                     with torch.cuda.use_mem_pool(self.param_nccl_mem_pool):
                         allocate_param_buffer()
                     try:
                         nccl_allocator.register_mem_pool(
                             self.param_nccl_mem_pool,
                             self.data_parallel_group,
                             symmetric=not self.ddp_config.disable_symmetric_registration,
                         )
                     except RuntimeError:
                         try:
                             nccl_allocator.deregister_mem_pool(
                                 self.param_nccl_mem_pool, self.data_parallel_group
                             )
                         except RuntimeError:
                             pass
                         raise
```
